 "source_instruction": "i need a black dress with an imported zipper.",
 "query": "Ugh, I swear the barista at my regular morning spot remembered my order for three whole months straight and then completely blanked today\u2014poured oat milk in my cold brew when I always get whole, even added extra vanilla when I specifically ask for no sweetener every single time. Then on my walk over here, a tiny fluffy golden retriever puppy darted right across the sidewalk in front of me, tugging its owner along like it was on a mission to chase a sparrow that hopped off a nearby fence, and I had to stop for five whole minutes just to scratch its ears because it kept nudging my hand with its wet little nose. I also realized halfway here that I left my favorite lip balm\u2014the mint one that has the little crack down the side from when I dropped it on the sidewalk last week\u2014sitting on my kitchen counter, and I\u2019ve been compulsively touching my chapped lips every two minutes since I noticed. Hey, can you help me look through the women's dresses section? I'm specifically looking for dresses that have an imported magnetic closure, and I want that one, the color I always grab without even having to say it out loud, you know the one? Oh right, and don't show me anything too pricey, just keep it reasonable, yeah? I don't need anything fancy beyond that, just those things sorted out for me to browse.",
